# OneX Forma copy-app (greenfield)

This repo is **OneX** — Electron desktop app to copy folders/files on **Autodesk Forma Data Management** (APS Data Management + Reviews). It is **not** Zviewer / IFC viewer work.

## North Star

- Viewer-free desktop tool: pick source/dest, cloud-side copy, filter, save scenarios, re-run.
- Same-project `copyFrom` only for MVP cloud copy (no download→upload path).
- Reviews filter uses Forma Reviews `approval-statuses` (`APPROVED`) — **not** DM `reviewStatus`.
- No dedicated app server for MVP (PKCE desktop; local scenarios; manual + interval triggers).
- Research in `0 Documents/1 - Thaoluan/**` is observation until PO signs a box.

## Repo map

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `apps/**` / `src/**` | Production code (when present) |
| `0 Documents/1 - Thaoluan/**` | Research, memos (observation) |
| `0 Documents/1-Sprints/**` | Campaign SSOT when signed (create on authorize) |
| `.cursor/**` | Rules, skills, agent profiles |

## Boundaries

- **Research ≠ authorize.** Draft analysis does not open implementation boxes.
- Telemetry/unit PASS ≠ product PASS. Prefer job reports + UI/APS product evidence.
- Secrets, credentials, raw HAR with tokens → redact before commit.
- Never commit files >100 MiB or embed large base64 blobs in markdown.
- Signed campaigns: follow PO governance — see `po-governance.mdc`.

## Language

- Agent logs & campaign SSOT: Vietnamese OK; code/identifiers: English.
- Commits: conventional (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, …) imperative subject.
